CHANGES MADE TO THE DERIVED CODE
================================

As required by section 5(a) of the AGPL. This list is maintained as the work
proceeds.

  * Renamed the namespace, assembly and plugin identity from QuestTracker to
    Time Memoria. Plugin metadata (author, description, repository, tags)
    replaced throughout.

Planned, not yet done:

  * Replace the user interface with Time Memoria's own: a two-panel questline
    tree, chain-grouped quest sections, and a suggested-next-quest panel.
  * Add features with no counterpart upstream — playtime pacing, world-state
    and maintenance reporting, MSQ progression gating, spoiler and free-trial
    modes, and class/job levelling with clipboard export.
  * Cache the generated quest tree to disk to remove the startup cost of
    rebuilding it from game data on every load.
  * Replace quest-ID probing for starting city, Grand Company and starting
    class with the equivalent PlayerState fields.


